  unitName: Demon Knight Febros
  unitId: 60874
  unitNumber: 1191
  description: The disciple of a high ranking god. Capable of changing his own body
    into weapons and armor, Febros served his divine master as a living shield. However,
    his whereabouts became unknown during the great war against humanity, after which
    he somehow became unwillingly involved in the Four Fallen Gods' plot. He was
    actually considered good enough to join their ranks as one of the Fallen Gods'
    disciples, but refused this offer stating that he would continue waiting for
    his original master.
  summonDesc: Only my master can control me.<br>Serving my master is my happiness.<br>I
    am here for my master's sake only.
  fusionDesc: Summoning arts...?<br>You use this power without truly<br>comprehending
    it, don't you...
